1
00:00:00,586 --> 00:00:02,056
(Howard:)Oh, yeah? How's that?

2
00:00:02,221 --> 00:00:05,161
Two words: 3D printer.

3
00:00:05,357 --> 00:00:08,387
But maybe it's three words.
No, hang on. Okay.

4
00:00:08,561 --> 00:00:12,661
(Raj:)One word, a letter and a number,
and maybe a hyphen.

5
00:00:12,865 --> 00:00:14,855
(Raj:)3D printer.

6
00:00:15,868 --> 00:00:18,458
(Howard:)I have always wanted a 3D printer.

7
00:00:18,637 --> 00:00:20,967
(Raj:)Of course you have.
They're an engineer's dream.

8
00:00:21,140 --> 00:00:24,270
(Raj:)Anything you can design,
a 3D printer can make out of plastic.

9
00:00:24,443 --> 00:00:26,643
(Howard:)Yeah, but they're so expensive.

10
00:00:26,812 --> 00:00:28,442
(Raj:)Oh, come on, you deserve one.

11
00:00:28,614 --> 00:00:31,604
(Raj:)You've worked hard to find a woman
who makes a lot of money.

12
00:00:33,686 --> 00:00:36,176
(Howard:)Well, the prices have been coming down.

13
00:00:36,388 --> 00:00:39,288
(Raj:)Oh, true.
They're practically giving them away.

14
00:00:39,458 --> 00:00:42,448
(Raj:)You know, in exchange for money.

15
00:00:42,661 --> 00:00:45,691
And we could make stuff we need
for work with it.

16
00:00:45,898 --> 00:00:49,298
(Howard:)Prototypes of my CAD/CAM designs,
specialized tools.

17
00:00:49,468 --> 00:00:53,628
(Raj:)Not to mention Malibu Koothrappali
and his totally bitching dream house.

18
00:00:54,907 --> 00:00:57,537
(Howard:)We don't need
Malibu Koothrappali's dream house.

19
00:00:57,710 --> 00:01:04,020
Really, smart guy? Where is he supposed
to park his sweet little Corvette?

